From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 20:23:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] MLB Matchup: add Pitcher Props card (best line/price per
 market)

New /api/mlb/pitcher-props endpoint returns, for each main pitcher market
(K, outs, hits, ER, walks, win), the lowest Over line and highest Under line
with the best price and book, for the pitcher's next game. Pick'em apps and
unbettable books excluded. The card sits under a denser Matchup Summary and
grades the last 10 starts against the consensus line.

